# QuickNotes

QuickNotes is a small browser-based note-taking app built with vanilla HTML, CSS and JavaScript. It lets users add short notes, assign each note to a category, search through saved notes, delete individual notes, and keep everything saved in the browser using `localStorage`. The app is responsive, so the form and note cards work well on both desktop and mobile screens.

## Features

- Add notes with a category: Personal, Work or Study
- Validate notes: empty notes and notes over 200 characters show an error
- Display notes as cards with category colour, date and time
- Delete individual notes
- Search notes by text, case-insensitive
- Show "No notes match your search." when search returns nothing
- Count message for zero, one or many notes
- Save and load notes with `localStorage`
- Responsive layout using Flexbox and a mobile media query
- Bonus: Clear all notes with a confirmation prompt

## How to run the project locally

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/your-username/quicknotes-app.git